# The Move to picker stays open when another program changes an unrelated line, so the project typed next is where the task goes.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
END
keys j gm
see Move to
outside <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
Home:
	- Fix the big shelf
END
see Fix the big shelf
type home
keys <Enter>
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
Home:
	- Fix the big shelf
	- Call the plumber
END
